{{Short description|none}}
These are the mintage quantities for strikings of the [[nickel (United States coin)|United States nickel]].
: '''P''' = [[Philadelphia Mint]] 
: '''D''' = [[Denver Mint]]
: '''S''' = [[San Francisco Mint]]
:'''W''' = [[West Point Mint]]

Parenthesis around the mint mark denotes that the coin does not have a mint mark on the coin, but was minted in that location.

